        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-SVY875017SBR Decorative 17 Inch Ornate Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 17 Inch Castle Appliance Pull is made from cast solid brass and completed in your choice of popular, high-quality finishes. It has a beautiful, ornate design that makes it great for and traditional home. This refrigerator pull is supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4 inch - 1 inch thick panels--which is the standard appliance panel thickness.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST04-specifications.gif?v=1704354544\" width=\"489\" height=\"235\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions SVY875017SBR Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in shorter version: <a href=\"/products/10-inch-castle-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-svy875010sbr\"><b>10 Inch Castle Appliance Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for FII-AP-SVY875017SBR Castle Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST04-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262232\"><b>First Impressions AP-SVY875017SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
